{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "得到了學園長的許可，也獲得了一筆資金。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且也按照計畫順利借到了烘培的場所！」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2572", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隔天的休息時間，我跟安潔兩人獨占了料理實習室。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為了休業式，終於要開始動手準備了。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然花了一整天交涉，不過能順利借到真是太好了。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，對了對了。放學後料理研的各位同學也會來呢。」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2573", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，今天我們只是借用一張桌子的感覺。」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天，第二學期的特別課程全部結束了，這間教室之後就不會用來上課。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "照往常的情況是料理研究會的學生們獨佔使用，而這次我們提出了借用的要求。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為休業式的前一天無論如何都想借用一整天。所以一開始還是和大家打好關係。」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是主人，非常擅長用話語讓女性聽從呢……」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，那個說法有點……」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為被主人說了甜言蜜語後，安潔立刻就神魂顛倒了喔！」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2575", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是因為是安潔吧。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，希望您那些甜言蜜語都只對安潔說。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2576", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她笑嘻嘻地說。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被她這麼開朗大方地戲弄，我不只不生氣反而還很開心。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就這層意義上來說，安潔比我擅長多了。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算是甜言蜜語，也只是『安潔今天也好可愛』、『喜歡妳』之類這種程度的話而已。」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為主人每天都說，所以安潔承受不了了。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2577", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說、現在也……那個、那個、主人……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2578", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安潔，過來。」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到安潔的眼睛一下子變得水汪汪，我立刻招手讓她到身邊來。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……啾、嗯呼……」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2579", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隨著擁抱，我輕輕吻住她誘人的唇。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……主人。」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2580", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「反正現在只有我們兩人……」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯嗯……主人，安潔的主人。喜歡喜歡喜歡～好喜歡您……」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2581", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔已經忍不住的感覺，她也伸手抱住我，用身體磨蹭。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果能讓她這麼高興，我倒是想每天都說。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……立刻就陶醉的安潔也好可愛，我最喜歡妳了。」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒錯，現在就是這樣。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……！」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2582", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她顫抖著發出呻吟，然後滿臉通紅地對我害羞一笑。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人。」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2583", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以把頭借給安潔一下嗎？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2584", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔彎身靠向我。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯♪」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2585", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她把我的頭抱在胸口。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人、主人……是胸部喔～」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2586", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈……有點難受，安潔。」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然比起難受更覺得舒服。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的臉埋在安潔柔軟的乳溝，每次呼吸都有安潔的香味……", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人喜歡的……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2587", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請盡情享受……面對安潔的時候，請隨您喜歡……」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2588", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那……我要磨蹭了喔。」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是……」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2589", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喜悅到達頂點，而我也感到快樂，所以就更高興了。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為我的「鬆懈」就是安潔最大的喜悅，所以我也毫不客氣地盡情享受。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然每次都是如此，不過這是我們兩人之間一種良好的循環。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好軟……」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯、嗯呼、嗯……」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2590", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為在學校裡通常沒辦法兩人獨處，所以我們現在盡情地享受。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直到身體終於分開，我們對彼此害臊地笑了笑。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸嘿……差不多來開始吧？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2591", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是，那首先要做什麼？」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「確定配方，然後做出試吃品來檢討。主人，就請您試吃看看囉♪」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「──所以，安潔首先做出了幾種。」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放學後，安潔立刻照中午擬定的配方烤了幾個試吃蛋糕。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的眼前擺放了５種蛋糕，剛出爐還熱騰騰的。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都要感謝資金充足，所以才能做試吃品呢，啊哈哈。」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2594", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「的確……如果學園長不同意的話還不知道該怎麼辦。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天去拜託的時候學園長很爽快就許可，而且還幫我們想到了後續的細節。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我還差得遠呢。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「得到了這麼大的幫助，我們一定要為休業式做出美味的蛋糕才行呢，安潔。」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，這也是報恩的一環呢！」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2595", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼……首先就請您試吃吧主人。安潔來切蛋糕喔！」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "帶著笑容同意我的話，安潔指了指蛋糕。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要從哪一種開始呢？」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～每一種看起來都很好吃……」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說妳真的很會做蛋糕呢，安潔。」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我眼前的蛋糕每一個都像專業的糕點師做的一樣美麗。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然知道她本來就擅長料理，不過水準高到這種程度我還是很驚訝。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔可以算是全能女僕呢，全部都多虧了母親的教導。」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「母親說過學得越多就能得到越多快樂。現在安潔很明白其中的道理了，呵呵呵。」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是啊哈哈的時候吧瓜生君！」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "ja0062", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此時，一句吐槽插了進來。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，抱歉吵到妳們了。」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如同剛才說的，放學後我們只借了一張桌子而已，所以其他桌子旁邊還有料理研的同學。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的很謝謝妳。班上同學有料理研的社員太好了。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "多虧了這女孩的幫忙，讓我們順利就借到了一塊位置。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「別管那個了，快點吃啦，真是的！安潔的蛋糕很讓人在意欸！」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "ja0063", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是蛋糕是蛋糕～」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社員A", "alt_speaker_idx": 289, "voice": "ra0000", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有這麼多……安潔的主人好好喔。」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社員B", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "rb0000", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "料理研的其他人都聚集到了我們的桌子旁。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正是如此，主人。不只是外表，也要試看看味道才行。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2600", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉抱歉，說的也是……那我就從旁邊這塊開始吃了。」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不對不對，第一塊應該選草莓蛋糕吧。」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "ja0064", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸～反而是收尾才對吧？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社員A", "alt_speaker_idx": 289, "voice": "ra0001", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想吃巧克力的……」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社員B", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "rb0001", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聚集過來的同學們都對安潔的蛋糕很感興趣，討論得很熱烈。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其實她們從剛才開始就一臉期待了。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊啊，那麼。」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔，機會難得，讓大家也幫忙試吃吧？」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說得也是呢。畢竟安潔烤了這麼多。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2601", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「各位，如果不嫌棄的話，請跟安潔的主人一起試吃吧！」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2602", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？我們也可以吃嗎！？太好了！」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "ja0065", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "料理研的大家都非常興奮。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟安潔對看了一眼。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那安潔就立刻照人數切囉～♪」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2603", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「耶耶♪」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社員A", "alt_speaker_idx": 289, "voice": "ra0002", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒想到這麼Lucky～」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社員B", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "rb0002", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過瓜生君，這些蛋糕是為了什麼的試吃呢？和安潔的聖誕節嗎？」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "ja0066", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，我之前沒有說明到這部份嗎？」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其實，主人和安潔要為休業式準備一個大蛋糕。」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2604", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大到足夠分給學校的每個人喔！」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ag2605", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
